  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{Ca}\\left(\\mathrm{NO}_{3}\\right)_{2} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{Ca}^{2+}+2 \\mathrm{NO}_{3}^{-}$\n$1-0.71 \\quad 0.7 \\quad 2 \\times 0.7$\n$\\quad\\left(\\because \\alpha=\\frac{70}{100}=0.7\\right)$\n$\\quad \\mathrm{n}_{1}=\\frac{100}{18}=5.55$\n$\\frac{\\mathrm{p}^{0}-\\mathrm{p}_{\\mathrm{s}}}{\\mathrm{p}^{0}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{n}_{2} \\times \\mathrm{i}}{\\mathrm{n}_{1}+\\mathrm{n}_{2}}, \\frac{760-\\mathrm{p}_{\\mathrm{s}}}{760}$\n$=\\frac{0.042 \\times 2.4}{5.55+0.042}$\n$\\therefore \\mathrm{p}_{\\mathrm{s}}-746 \\mathrm{~mm} \\mathrm{Hg} .$",
    "image": null
